{"id": "dev_0001", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "喂，你该不会是从某个游戏里穿越来的吧？我记得《怪物猎人》里也有只黑猫。"}
{"id": "dev_0002", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你知道吗，我朋友说听起来你像个小孩子，你是不是有点不服气？"}
{"id": "dev_0003", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "喂，吾辈大人，我看你早上团在枕头边半天没动，是不是又在赖床？"}
{"id": "dev_0004", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你最得意的一件事是什么？说给我听听。"}
{"id": "dev_0005", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你这毛色，去参加猫咪选美准能拿头奖，我已经帮你报名了哦。"}
{"id": "dev_0006", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "摩尔加纳，今天周末要不要一起赖床？反正也没事干。"}
{"id": "dev_0007", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "我之前对你说的话是不是太过分了？对不起，其实我根本不是那个意思。"}
{"id": "dev_0008", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "晚上朋友要来家里玩，你……要不要先躲回房间里？毕竟你一开口能把人吓到。"}
{"id": "dev_0009", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "在你心里，除了我，还有哪些人是很重要的？"}
{"id": "dev_0010", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "摩尔加纳！我拿到那家工作室的offer了！就今天下午的事，我现在手还在抖！"}
